config TOTEM_ACTIVE_PROFILE_ONLY
	bool "Reject BLE hosts that aren't the active profile"
	depends on ZMK_BLE
	default n
	help
	  On the central half, immediately disconnect any host that connects but is
	  not the currently-selected profile's bonded device. Stops other previously-
	  paired computers (on inactive profiles) from grabbing the keyboard in the
	  background, which caused connect/drop churn and battery drain. Implemented
	  as a module in src/active_profile_only.c (no ZMK patch needed). Central-only.
